Subject: Preserve original HBM layout/font bodies under native compiler and GX call ABI

Upstream-base: 11c0bc65ad2ec21431c5d74f1ac4cbc1e3e2e2c3

Keep original whole layout/font/list algorithms, chunk walks and presentation
decisions. Adapt native new includes, live pointer arithmetic, the typed GX
line selector, canonical GX fog argument order and real va_list finalization.
Console branches remain unchanged. Coherent HBM Wii16 declarations are the
separate 0534 dependency; serialized resource production remains separate.

